        "Content": "* PLEASE EMAIL ONLY AND WE WILL THEN ADVISE OF VIEWING ARRANGEMENTS **                    \r\n\r\n                                                             ** Spacious 5 Bed Unfurnished Property to Rent **\r\n\r\nThis impressive five-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally situated within one of the area’s most sought-after residential estates, overlooking a generous area of attractive communal green space. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the large property measures approximately 240 sq mt / 2.583 sq ft and is offered to the rental market unfurnished and provides spacious, well-proportioned accommodation ideal for modern living. A particular feature is the exceptionally large master bedroom suite, which incorporates a dressing room, en-suite bathroom and mezzanine level, creating a superb private retreat. The property also benefits from a private rear garden and access to communal tennis courts, providing excellent recreational facilities within the development.\r\n\r\nOrpen is a highly sought-after, mature residential development ideally positioned just off the N11 and within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities. The development is particularly well suited to modern living, with a large green area located just moments from No.29, along with two communal tennis courts.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well served by a number of highly regarded schools, including Carysfort National School, All Saints National School, St. Andrew’s College, Blackrock College, Loreto Foxrock, Oatlands College and Mount Anville, among others. UCD and the UCD Michael Smurfit Graduate Business School are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThere is an excellent choice of recreational amenities nearby, including Carysfort Park, Blackrock Park and the coastline. Both Stillorgan and Blackrock Village are within walking distance, offering a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and services, while several major shopping centres are also conveniently accessible.\r\n\r\nPublic transport links are excellent, with the N11 Quality Bus Corridor close by and Blackrock DART Station within walking distance, providing quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nThe well laid out accommodation briefly comprises, entrance hallway with guest wc and large under stairs cloaks cupboard, living room, large kitchen / dining room, family room, playroom / study. Upstairs are 5 bedrooms two of which are en-suite and main bathroom. The main bedroom suite incorporates a bedroom area, dressing room, ensuite and mezzanine level and provides for a wonderful and private retreat."
      },
